This is __NOT__ PHPWiki. Please read [http://www.tikiwiki.org/tiki-index.php?page=WikiSyntax|Tiki Markup]. 

As a stylistic note, since __this__ Wiki is meant for content related to ((Lojban)), and ((Lojban)) makes very little use of capital letters, and in fact tends to look ugly if you capitalize it, we'd like to standardize on the use of double parentheses, ~np~(( ))~/np~, around links.